" tentative automatique de tushare ne fonctionnaient pas."

#: ../../source/RELEASE_HISTORY.md:552
msgid "1.1.9 (2024-04-09)"
msgstr "Version 1.1.9 (2024-04-09)"

#: ../../source/RELEASE_HISTORY.md:554
msgid "**分钟数据**   修复本地分钟数据提取偶发错误；兼容性改进。"
msgstr ""
