#~ msgid ""
#~ "Fixed backtest report \"Total operation fee\" always showing zero when daily"
#~ " evaluation uses `evaluate_price_data`. Fees were aggregated by date but "
#~ "then reindexed against the daily index that carries a time-of-day (e.g. "
